{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum cooling‑off period an NBFC must give a borrower to exit a digital loan is one day.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000226575, "gen_latency_s": 0.9580871999933152, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3021, "output_tokens": 96, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000226575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0050", "D16_A_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.041526600005454384, "total_latency_s": 0.9997255999915069, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If a lender processes digital lending data outside India, that data must be deleted from the servers outside India and transferred back to servers located within India within 24 hours of processing.", "citations": ["D16_A_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002526, "gen_latency_s": 1.2381746000028215, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2984, "output_tokens": 192, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002526, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0011", "D14_A_0008"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03797920000215527, "total_latency_s": 1.2762619999994058, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover for a digital lending portfolio is five per cent of the total amount disbursed out of that loan portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_A_0024", "D16_A_0025"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023827499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.083957900002133, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3057, "output_tokens": 126, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000238275, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0025", "D16_A_0028", "D16_A_0026", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0024"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.036864699999568984, "total_latency_s": 1.120957199993427, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.2, "first_hit_rank": 5, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank.", "citations": ["D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022695, "gen_latency_s": 0.7599307999917073, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3002, "output_tokens": 102, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022695, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0013", "D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.037962300004437566, "total_latency_s": 0.7979902000079164, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.25, "first_hit_rank": 4, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A lending service provider must display, for each loan offer, the name(s) of the lender(s) extending the offer, the loan amount and tenor, the APR, the monthly repayment obligation and any applicable penalty charges, and provide a link to the key facts sheet of each lender, in a way that enables the borrower to make a fair comparison between offers.", "citations": ["D16_A_0012"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000245625, "gen_latency_s": 1.0108940999925835, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3099, "output_tokens": 140, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000245625, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0012", "D12_A_0051", "D12_A_0068", "D16_A_0018", "D12_A_0040"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0382856000069296, "total_latency_s": 1.049291200004518, "hit@5": 0, "rr@10": 0.0, "first_hit_rank": null, "gold_cited": false}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that such fee is disclosed to the borrower upfront in the Know‑Your‑Customer (KYC) form.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023955, "gen_latency_s": 1.3108856000035303, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2938, "output_tokens": 160, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00023955, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03948809999565128, "total_latency_s": 1.3504802999959793, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. An NBFC’s Digital Lending Application (DLA) or its LSP must not access a borrower’s mobile phone resources such as the contact list, photos (file and media), call logs or other telephony functions. Only a one‑time access to camera, microphone or location is permitted for onboarding/KYC with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002595, "gen_latency_s": 1.0879328000009991, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3088, "output_tokens": 189, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002595, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0014", "D12_A_0104", "D12_A_0085"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.036196200002450496, "total_latency_s": 1.1242385000077775, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If an NBFC or its linked LSP does not reply to a borrower’s complaint within 30 days, or if the borrower is dissatisfied with a reply or a rejection, the borrower can lodge a complaint with the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme via the CMS portal (https://cms.rbi.org.in/) or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre in Chandigarh, as per the RBI’s grievance‑redressal mechanism.", "citations": ["D16_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000251475, "gen_latency_s": 0.9233425999991596, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3021, "output_tokens": 179, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000251475, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04224900000554044, "total_latency_s": 0.965693399994052, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A new payment aggregator must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore at the time of submitting its application for authorisation, and it must reach a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year after authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_A_0005"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000241725, "gen_latency_s": 1.0813541999959853, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3015, "output_tokens": 148, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000241725, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0006", "D13_A_0006", "D13_A_0012", "D06_A_0004"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.035296100002597086, "total_latency_s": 1.1167541999893729, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An entity that was carrying on only PA‑P business had to apply for authorisation by 31 December 2025. If it failed to apply by that date it must notify its banker(s) immediately and wind up its business by 28 February 2026.", "citations": ["D06_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000263625, "gen_latency_s": 1.2370383999950718, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3051, "output_tokens": 212, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000263625, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0014", "D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0007"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.047234300000127405, "total_latency_s": 1.284406399994623, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A11", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank payment aggregator must keep the funds it collects for merchants in a separate escrow account with any Scheduled Commercial Bank (SCB) in India.", "citations": ["D06_A_0014"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002148, "gen_latency_s": 0.747988200004329, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2800, "output_tokens": 112, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002148, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["X01_A_0000", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0010", "D06_A_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04749189999711234, "total_latency_s": 0.7955880999943474, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.2, "first_hit_rank": 5, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Existing payment aggregators had to achieve a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by March 31, 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by March 31, 2023.", "citations": ["D05_A_0003"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00025604999999999996, "gen_latency_s": 4.444508999993559, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3138, "output_tokens": 165, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00025605, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_A_0004", "D05_A_0003", "D05_A_0005", "D06_A_0005", "D05_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.05721919999632519, "total_latency_s": 4.501829599990742, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For digital payment transactions that are not card‑present, at least one of the authentication factors must be dynamic – that is, it must be created or proven in a way that the proof of possession is unique to that transaction.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000243525, "gen_latency_s": 0.96303369999805, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2959, "output_tokens": 168, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000243525, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0006", "D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0004"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.048785299994051456, "total_latency_s": 1.0119561000028625, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Payment system providers must comply with the RBI’s Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_A_0000"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233175, "gen_latency_s": 1.4308613000030164, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3085, "output_tokens": 102, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0004", "D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.038391299996874295, "total_latency_s": 1.4693603000050643, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The RBI directions state that for a digital payment transaction at least two distinct factors of authentication must be used; one factor must be dynamic (unique to the transaction); and the factors must be robust so that compromise of one factor does not affect the reliability of the other, thereby ensuring their independence.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023745, "gen_latency_s": 1.0903263999935007, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2914, "output_tokens": 159, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00023745, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D11_A_0007", "D06_A_0006", "D06_A_0022", "D13_A_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03271780000068247, "total_latency_s": 1.1231445999874268, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A16", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum value of a prepaid gift instrument is Rs.10,000/-.", "citations": ["D11_A_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022575, "gen_latency_s": 1.6120395000034478, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3010, "output_tokens": 96, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0020", "D11_A_0019", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0018", "D11_A_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.033591599989449605, "total_latency_s": 1.6457250000094064, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A17", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum validity period of a Prepaid Payment Instrument (PPI) is one year from the date of its last loading or reloading.", "citations": ["D11_A_0032"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022904999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.247568399994634, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2958, "output_tokens": 120, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022905, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0032", "D11_A_0005", "D11_A_0033", "D11_A_0004", "D11_A_0006"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.032167700002901256, "total_latency_s": 1.2798259999981383, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A18", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum amount outstanding allowed in a full‑KYC PPI is Rs. 2,00,000 at any point of time.", "citations": ["D11_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023002499999999997, "gen_latency_s": 1.1047991999948863, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2967, "output_tokens": 121, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000230025, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0019", "D11_A_0020", "D11_A_0018", "D11_A_0037", "D11_A_0016"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03597379999700934, "total_latency_s": 1.1408744000073057, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A19", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No, a small PPI does not allow cash withdrawal or funds transfer. Small PPIs are limited to purchase of goods and services only, and any withdrawal of cash or transfer of funds from such PPIs is not permitted.", "citations": ["D11_A_0003"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023752500000000001, "gen_latency_s": 1.2063683000014862, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2871, "output_tokens": 170, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000237525, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0003", "D11_A_0019", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0017", "D11_A_0057"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.035073899998678826, "total_latency_s": 1.241545999990194, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A20", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC‑AA must have a net owned fund of at least rupees two crore.", "citations": ["D13_A_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022889999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.783877299996675, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3052, "output_tokens": 96, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002289, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0006", "D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0007", "D13_A_0008", "D13_A_0017"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03331810000236146, "total_latency_s": 0.8172983999975258, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A21", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No, an account aggregator (NBFC‑AA) is not authorized to process payment transactions for its customers. The RBI direction on Account Aggregators specifies that their business is entirely information‑technology driven and that they must not store or request customer credentials used for authenticating customers to financial information providers. There is no provision allowing them to process or settle payment transactions.", "citations": ["D13_A_0012"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022755, "gen_latency_s": 0.8368960000079824, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2714, "output_tokens": 176, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022755, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0002", "X01_A_0000", "D06_A_0003", "D13_A_0012", "D11_A_0029"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03239979999489151, "total_latency_s": 0.8693987999868114, "hit@5": 0, "rr@10": 0.0, "first_hit_rank": null, "gold_cited": false}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A22", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The customer’s consent obtained by an NBFC‑AA must be a standardised consent artefact.  The artefact must contain:\n1. Identity of the customer (and optional contact information);\n2. The nature of the financial information requested;\n3. The purpose for collecting such information;\n4. The identity of the recipients of the information, if any;\n5. A URL or other address to which notification needs to be sent each time the consent artefact is used to access information;\n6. Consent creation date, expiry date, identity and signature or digital signature of the NBFC‑AA; and\n7. Any other attribute as may be prescribed by the Reserve Bank.\nThe artefact can be obtained in electronic form, must be capable of being logged, audited and verified, and a fresh consent artefact must be issued upon revocation (including partial revocation).", "citations": ["D13_A_0010", "D13_A_0011"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000309825, "gen_latency_s": 1.3623042999970494, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3027, "output_tokens": 276, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000309825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0011", "D13_A_0010", "D13_A_0003", "D13_A_0009"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03536069999972824, "total_latency_s": 1.3980854999972507, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
